<title>USA: Annapolis, Md., approves $40 mln fiscal '98 budget.</title>
<headline>Annapolis, Md., approves $40 mln fiscal '98 budget.</headline>
<dateline>ANNAPOLIS, Md. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Annapolis City Council has adopted a $40 million budget for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>The budget includes a property tax cut from $1.69 to $1.68 per $100 of assessed value.</p>
<p>The council also included funds to renovate the deteriorating Stanton Community Center.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
